n individuals who consume little or no alcohol. It can be associated with various factors, including iron overload. The presence of excess fat in the liver can lead to further complications if not managed properly."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}